<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>School Bookstore Survey</title>
</head>

<body>

    <div align="center">
        <h1>School Bookstore Survey Portal</h1>

        <p>
            This is a survey conducted in our school to know about your book buying habits.
        </p>

        <p>
            Kindly complete the survey and fill your information accurately.
        </p>
    </div>

    <form>

        <h2><b>Basic Information</b></h2>

        <fieldset>

            <label>Name:</label>
            <input type="text" required>
            <br><br>

            <label>Class:</label>
            <input type="text" required>
            <br><br>

            <label>Enrollment No.:</label>
            <input type="text" required>
            <br><br>

            <label>Address:</label>
            <input type="text" required>
            <br><br>

            <label>City:</label>
            <input type="text" required>
            <br><br>

            <label>Pin Code:</label>
            <input type="number" required>
            <br><br>

            <label>Email ID:</label>
            <input type="email" required>
            <br><br>

        </fieldset>

        <h2><b>Survey Questions</b></h2>

        <fieldset>

            <label>
                Question 1: Which type of book do you prefer to buy?
            </label>
            <br><br>

            <select>
                <option>Academic</option>
                <option>Fiction/Thriller</option>
                <option>Novels</option>
                <option>Other</option>
            </select>

            <br><br>

            <label>
                Question 2: Where do you usually purchase your books?
            </label>
            <br><br>

            <select>
                <option>Online platforms</option>
                <option>Stationaries</option>
                <option>Through seniors</option>
                <option>Other</option>
            </select>

            <br><br>

            <label>
                Question 3: How much time do you usually spend on your books?
            </label>
            <br><br>

            <select>
                <option>1-2 hours</option>
                <option>3-4 hours</option>
                <option>5-6 hours</option>
                <option>Other</option>
            </select>

            <br><br>

            <label>
                Question 4: How much money do you usually spend on books?
            </label>
            <br><br>

            <select>
                <option>₹0-₹500</option>
                <option>₹501-₹1000</option>
                <option>₹1001-₹2000</option>
                <option>Other</option>
            </select>

            <br><br>

            <label>
                Question 5: How often do you purchase books?
            </label>
            <br><br>

            <select>
                <option>monthly</option>
                <option>half-yearly</option>
                <option>yearly</option>
                <option>Other</option>
            </select>

            <br><br>

            <label>
                Question 6: How much would you rate the school bookstore?
            </label>
            <br><br>

            <select>
                <option>Excellent</option>
                <option>Good</option>
                <option>Average</option>
                <option>Poor</option>
            </select>

            <br><br>

        </fieldset>

        <h2><b>Feedback</b></h2>

        <fieldset>

            <label>
                Any suggestions for improving the bookstore:
            </label>

            <br><br>

            <textarea rows="8" cols="80"
                placeholder="Write your suggestions here..."></textarea>

        </fieldset>

        <br><br>

        <input type="checkbox" required>
        I agree to the terms and conditions of this survey and confirm that the information
        provided is accurate to the best of my knowledge.

        <br><br>

        <input type="submit" value="Submit">

        <br><br>

        <input type="reset" value="Reset">

    </form>

</body>

</html>
